{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656460/extras/header.png?t=1725379566\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656460/extras/jimmy.png?t=1725379566\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656460/extras/line.png?t=1725379566\" /><br><br><strong>The Wolf of Wall Street... with lasers.</strong><br><br>You\u2019re the newly appointed CEO of Vostok Inc. As a greedy, space-capitalist your ultimate goal is to get filthy, stinking, rich!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656460/extras/weapons_-_copia.gif.jpg?t=1725379566\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656460/extras/shooter_-_copia.gif.jpg?t=1725379566\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656460/extras/jacuzzi_-_copia.gif_(1).jpg?t=1725379566\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656460/extras/building-_copia.gif_(2).jpg?t=1725379566\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656460/extras/mercedes.png?t=1725379566\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/656460/extras/line.png?t=1725379566\" /><br><br>First, you\u2019ll need to raise some start-up capital by twin-stick blasting enemies, asteroids and anything else that gets in your way. Once you\u2019ve collected enough moolah it\u2019s time to land on planets and start mining, terraforming and colonizing.<br><br>Use that extra moolah to upgrade your ship, craft weapons and build more planetside business enterprises to rake make even more moolah!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shar